{"id":"108e3effa1769d1d","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-sacks-splitting.md","title":"Sacks分裂定理","display":"thm-sacks-splitting — Sacks分裂定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-sacks-splitting","aliases":["43-thm-sacks-splitting"],"display":"thm-sacks-splitting — Sacks分裂定理","depends_on":["[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Theorem 5.10.1, print pp.30–32 / PDF pp.50–52","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"statement-checked","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-sacks-splitting"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-sacks-splitting</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-sacks-splitting — Sacks分裂定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 5.10.1, print pp.30–32 / PDF pp.50–52"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>为不可计算c.e.集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_T\">\\(\\le_T\\)</span> 分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_0,A_1\">\\(A_0,A_1\\)</span> 量化于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land A\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists A_0,A_1\\ (\\operatorname{CE}(A_0)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(A_1)\\land A=A_0\\cup A_1\\land A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\not\\le_TA_1\\land A_1\\not\\le_TA_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land A\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists A_0,A_1\\ (\\operatorname{CE}(A_0)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(A_1)\\land A=A_0\\cup A_1\\land A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\not\\le_TA_1\\land A_1\\not\\le_TA_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将A每次新枚举元素分给恰好一个分支，并用最长一致长度控制损伤；非计算性防止某一需求无穷地保护错误的全归约。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 5.10.1, print pp.30–32 / PDF pp.50–52。版本为用户提供的 2007-07-28 草稿。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CE}$ 与 $\\le_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]；$A_0,A_1$ 量化于 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{CE}$ 与 $\\le_T$ 分别采用 [[43-df-ce]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]；$A_0,A_1$ 量化于 $\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_T","display":false},{"tex":"A_0,A_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CE}(A)\\land A\\not\\le_T\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists A_0,A_1\\ (\\operatorname{CE}(A_0)\\land\\operatorname{CE}(A_1)\\land A=A_0\\cup A_1\\land A_0\\cap A_1=\\varnothing\\land A_0\\not\\le_TA_1\\land A_1\\not\\le_TA_0).","display":true}],"bytes":1220,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-thm-sacks-splitting]] — Sacks分裂定理"}],"outgoing":["6c0559518cd32104","0784d1de3a88cd94"]}